179
00:18:00,773 --> 00:18:02,333
[SPEAKER_06]: You know what a battery is, pitcher and catcher?

180
00:18:02,893 --> 00:18:04,074
[SPEAKER_06]: If I didn't know what a battery was.

181
00:18:06,774 --> 00:18:10,555
[SPEAKER_06]: He says, Alexander's pitching, you know, I got three hits off Alexander in that game.

182
00:18:13,450 --> 00:18:18,591
