[SPEAKER_06]: We never did talk much about his career in Chicago.

201
00:19:21,459 --> 00:19:25,000
[SPEAKER_06]: It wasn't convenient to talk much about anything in those circumstances.

202
00:19:25,020 --> 00:19:27,821
