205
00:19:38,793 --> 00:19:43,878
[SPEAKER_06]: Let him talk about these stories and try to remember them and tape them afterwards.

206
00:19:49,403 --> 00:19:54,508
[SPEAKER_06]: Now... What else here?

207
00:20:09,398 --> 00:20:13,660
[SPEAKER_06]: Yeah, he was with Kansas City in the later 20s.

208
00:20:15,180 --> 00:20:21,423
