217
00:21:08,127 --> 00:21:09,587
[SPEAKER_06]: So that was in very good condition.

218
00:21:12,557 --> 00:21:15,259
[SPEAKER_06]: He said this was the only one they gave out or something like that.

219
00:21:15,279 --> 00:21:16,940
[SPEAKER_06]: I don't know quite why that would be the case.

220
00:21:20,323 --> 00:21:20,783
[SPEAKER_06]: Okay.

221
00:21:22,565 --> 00:21:29,610
[SPEAKER_06]: At Kansas City, Spencer Abbott was the manager, I guess, and they were teammates.

