00:21:42,908 --> 00:21:47,990
[SPEAKER_06]: Michael Boone got into an awful fight with Spencer Abbott.

224
00:21:48,630 --> 00:22:03,536
[SPEAKER_06]: I think this is on my first Luke Boone tape, which explains why he was with Kansas City just a short time and was then traded off to Louisville or maybe Louisville.

