00:22:12,805 --> 00:22:20,188
[SPEAKER_06]: When I'm talking to him yesterday, he says, uh, this, uh, I had to step in between those two.

228
00:22:20,208 --> 00:22:21,369
[SPEAKER_06]: That was quite a fight, you know.

229
00:22:21,649 --> 00:22:24,710
[SPEAKER_06]: I wanted him to really get on it all, to that effect.

