264
00:24:40,341 --> 00:24:43,322
[SPEAKER_06]: And he introduced me to people who went along.

265
00:24:44,887 --> 00:24:50,091
[SPEAKER_06]: One chap we met was a guy named Humminger, or Hummiger.

266
00:24:51,932 --> 00:24:54,995
