276
00:25:35,427 --> 00:25:37,328
[SPEAKER_06]: But again, I wouldn't pay much attention to this thing.

277
00:25:37,388 --> 00:25:39,709
[SPEAKER_06]: I was disgusted with the whole thing and ready to get out of there.

278
00:25:41,658 --> 00:25:49,224
[SPEAKER_06]: So I didn't really take much note of what he was saying or try to get much more out of it.

