280
00:25:51,545 --> 00:25:55,108
[SPEAKER_06]: I'd have got a lot of data if I could remember it all.

281
00:25:55,908 --> 00:25:57,670
[SPEAKER_06]: And maybe if Rita had been there, she would have remembered it.

282
00:25:58,430 --> 00:26:00,332
[SPEAKER_06]: And maybe he would have sobbed up a bit.

283
00:26:02,413 --> 00:26:09,078
[SPEAKER_06]: And I don't think he ever would have let the tape recorder go on, or even note-taking.

