00:26:09,098 --> 00:26:10,159
[SPEAKER_06]: I doubt whether he would have permitted that.

285
00:26:12,698 --> 00:26:19,860
[SPEAKER_06]: As I say, I kind of debated him at first there to be, to prevent his just leaving me high and dry without anything, not even an explanation.

286
00:26:21,320 --> 00:26:23,561
[SPEAKER_06]: But he warmed up a little bit, thought out.

287
00:26:23,581 --> 00:26:30,062
[SPEAKER_06]: It was a, really a disappointment.

288
00:26:30,082 --> 00:26:35,724
[SPEAKER_06]: The way he talked on the phone, in his loud, outgoing manner, a lot of stories.

289
00:26:35,764 --> 00:26:37,904
[SPEAKER_06]: I was sure it was going to be one of my best interviews ever.

290
00:26:38,645 --> 00:26:39,625
[SPEAKER_06]: I was just sure of this.

291
00:26:42,369 --> 00:26:43,489
[SPEAKER_06]: So I can imagine the blow.

292
