[SPEAKER_06]: It wasn't nothing at all.

293
00:26:50,352 --> 00:27:11,619
[SPEAKER_06]: Well, to finish up the day then, since there isn't much more to tell about Ralph Michaels on this tape, and the tape has got a long way to go, I'll describe our trip home and then talk about some of the

