00:27:28,631 --> 00:27:30,431
[SPEAKER_06]: It stopped raining by now.

297
00:27:30,451 --> 00:27:35,632
[SPEAKER_06]: The sun was shining, but it was awfully muddy and mud splashing all over our windshield on the way.

298
00:27:36,872 --> 00:27:39,873
[SPEAKER_06]: But we got out of Pittsburgh, okay, and

