00:27:43,029 --> 00:27:45,651
[SPEAKER_06]: It was on again, off again, all the rest of the way back.

301
00:27:45,871 --> 00:27:55,858
[SPEAKER_06]: We stopped about five o'clock at the Dallas Pike Cherokee Inn there for supper, had a nice supper, and then resumed our way home.

302
00:27:56,098 --> 00:27:58,680
[SPEAKER_06]: We arrived here about a quarter to seven.

303
00:28:00,381 --> 00:28:01,362
[SPEAKER_06]: It got dark then.

